# Setup: Consider Binary MSM (Secondary): p0=0.10 case only for simplicity
#     All other parts of the code remain unchanged except for
#   - (a) change in pilot size: n_pilot = 200 
#   - (b) multiple correlated confounders: Three correlated confounders
#   - (c) perturbation to the underlying causal model: final PS slope = 0.4/1.2
